    <string name="about_license_body">I-Muslim iwuhlelo lokusebenza lwamahhala, lomthombo ovulekile ngokuphelele ngaphansi kwelayisensi ye-GPLv3 - azikho izikhangiso, akukho ukubhalisa, akukho ukulandelwa. Noma iyiphi inguqulo eshintshiwe ihlala ingumthombo ovulekile.</string>
