    <string name="privacy_body">I-Muslim iyabuhlonipha ubumfihlo bakho futhi ayiqoqi idatha yakho.\n\n• Akukho ukulandelela: awekho ama-SDK esikhangiso, ama-analytics noma ama-trackers okumaketha.\n• Idatha ihlala kudivayisi yakho: yonke idatha yakho (indawo, izilungiselelo, amabhukumaka) igcinwa endaweni kudivayisi yakho kuphela.997000 qibla kudivayisi yakho, futhi azithunyelwa kunoma iyiphi iseva yangaphandle.\n• Izimvume kuphela uma zidingeka: sicela izimvume (indawo, izaziso) kuphela uma isici sizidinga ngempela, ngencazelo ecacile.\n• Akukho ukuxhumana okuphoqelekile: uhlelo lokusebenza lusebenza ungaxhunyiwe ku-inthanethi; ukusetshenziswa kwenethiwekhi kungokuzithandela ngokuphelele kokwengeziwe okufana nokulanda iziphindaphindo.\n\nLe nqubomgomo iyingxenye yenqolobane yomthombo ovulekile futhi ivulekele ukubuyekezwa komphakathi.</string>
